    "image": "Photorealistic live-action film still, landscape 16:9, no black bars. Image 1 is camera/layout authority ONLY, not appearance: preserve its eye-level 40mm perspective, elderly woman LEFT beside a standing stone and adult DIAXI RIGHT, full-size two-person conversation. Extend vertical field to 16:9 without copying clay models. Image 2 supplies the natural dark gneiss, moss, birches, river and cloudy northern waterfall environment. Image 3 is DIAXI's EXACT original face, body, hair and costume authority. Image 4 is the elderly shaman's exact face, tattoos, costume and staff authority. Image 5 supplies the photoreal finish, elderly identity, hut atmosphere and carved stone material. BEFORE ritual: Vegvisir carved but DARK, no glow. Exactly two adult women. Shaman stands just left of stone, turning toward DIAXI with grave restrained concern, one black-feather staff in her LEFT hand, RIGHT hand free at side for later touch. DIAXI stands screen right, hurt, quiet and determined, facing three-quarter left toward shaman. Match DIAXI's original ivory off-shoulder deep-V embroidered laced dress, broad ornate brown belt with hanging cords, layered split skirt and tall brown fur-trimmed laceup boots precisely, no redesign. Long brown/gold highlighted braided hair and forehead marking. Shaman wears silver braids, wrinkled face, branching facial tattoos, dark weathered wool/leather with burgundy embroidered linen and black feather left shoulder. Both faces readable. Human eye-height camera 1.55m, natural 40mm perspective and depth, full women visible. At far left a partial old blackened-timber shaman hut with steep uneven turf roof, hanging roots, bones and feathers, small warm window, one black raven perched on crooked branch; keep secondary. Ordinary upland river and forest behind DIAXI, waterfall downstream OFF SCREEN RIGHT, no new waterfall in background. Continuous full-size natural terrain and overcast sky light, subtle wind. Stone taller than shaman with same engraved Vegvisir as references. Tactile cloth, natural skin, damp rock, fine subtle film grain, muted dark fantasy photographed on location. No illustration, miniature, clay, plastic, game render, toy trees, low-poly rocks, floating terrain edges, text, subtitles, logos or watermark.",
